# TODO: Trip Ready auth email branding (Resend)

Organisers use **email + password** (not magic link). Resend is only needed for password reset / confirm-email later.

## When they ask
1. Resend account + API key + verified domain
2. Supabase → Authentication → SMTP: `smtp.resend.com`, port `465`, user `resend`, password = API key; sender name `Trip Ready`
3. Then turn Confirm email / recovery emails back on if desired

Travellers join with invite code + email. Do not push Resend until they ask.
